map.[hota] a gambling place.quest.124.13:
"Seeking the dragon divides the gold and looks at the winding mountain, each winding layer is a barrier;

If the gate has eight layers of danger, it will not emerge without the Yin and Yang Bagua formation."

This refers to ancient Chinese geomantic and divinatory practices, where the "dragon" and "gold" are metaphors for the placement of auspicious sites and treasures. The winding mountain is a symbol of the challenges and obstacles one must navigate, while the "eight layers of danger" and the "Yin and Yang Bagua" suggest a deep connection to mystical, esoteric knowledge used for protection or uncovering hidden truths.

map.[hota] portishead.guards.102.22.1.me:
{Mage:}
Welcome, hero. What are you looking for?

{Hero:}
I´m not certain. Do you have any advice for me?

{Mage:}
Right now, I do not have an advice for you. However, what I can is tell you about a dream I had last night. My memory of it is hazy, as it usually is with prophetic dreams, but what I remeber with absolute clarity is a terrain littered with {HOLES}.

{Hero:}
Holes??

{Mage:}
Yes. Holes in the ground everywhere. I believe this is the information that will help you.

{Hero:}
How are some holes supposed to help me on my quest?!

{Mage:}
You will understand when you find them. You wanted an advice? Well there you have it, you have to search for a hole in the ground!

map.[hota] portishead.guards.114.208.1.m:
{Hero:}
"Greetings to the noble Genie"

{Genie:}
"You too be greeted, hero, what do you ask for?"

{Hero:}
"I´m looking for Satyr, Rogue and Leprechaun. Do you know where I could find them?"

{Genie:}
"Satyr and Rogue are here further down the road, and not far from here you can certainly find Leprechaun, but you have to use a boat to get to him"

{Hero:}
"Thank you very much!" "Do you have any good travel advice for me?"

{Genie:}
“Beyond this gate resides the most powerful Hero named Mephala, no other hero has ever defeated her. It is {not neccesary} for you to defeat her to continue your journey, she doesn't own anything important."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.115.161.0.m:
{Hugo:}
"Hey Boss, I think I cought a whiff of the one-eyed captain!"

{Boss:}
"Stop spouting nonsense, you can´t find even your own grandmother" "Shut up and keep a lookout!"

{Hugo:}
"No, seriously Boss, come here and I'll show you!"

{Boss:}
"Fuck, show me then. But if there´s nothing, I'll wring your neck, you idiot!"

{Hugo:}
"Oh oh yes, my lord!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.130.153.0.m:
{Gelu:}
"Thank, you captain, for freeing me from the prison. I heard you are being chased by Hugo and Boss, the terrible criminals. I will help you! I´m going to sail {SOUTH} to my forest and bring reinforcements. I have an army of thousands Sharpshooters there.
For now, you go {NORTH} and conquer Lord Haart's kingdom"

"{I´ll keep my army, but I have no need for the Wayfarer's Boots and Equestrian Gloves, as I have the Boots of Speed safely hidden in my forest and that's enough for me.} So, if you´d like, they are free for you to take."

{Captain:}
"Alright, thank you, it´s a deal then. You go SOUTH, and I'll will go NORTH. I wish you good luck!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.132.233.0.m:
{Troll:}
"Hey captain, I have to get out of here, my two wives keep beating me and swearing at me"
"I heard the pirates have hidden treasure somewhere near here.
Rumor has it that it's under the {biggest tree}.
Let's find it and dig it out!"

{Capitan:}
"Ok, Troll, I'll take you with me. Haven't you heard of a harbor called Portishead?

{Troll:}
"No, I've never heard of Portishead... but it's surely where the treasure must be hidden. It is close by on the sandy beach over there. Let's go find it!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.133.237.0.m:
{Troll:}
"Ahoooy Captain, where are you sailing?"

"Take me with you, I'll pay you!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.139.81.0.me:
{Hero:}
"Greetings, great wizard. Where does this gate lead to? Also, have you heard of the port of Portishead?"

{Wizard:}
"I greet you too, traveler. Yes, I know the port of Portishead as this gate leads straight to the city where the port lies. Unfortunately, the gate has been destroyed and it´s impossible to pass through."

"Your only alternative is through a portal. Though even if you manage to get there, you won´t be able to enter the port without a key, Titan's Thunder. Unfortunately, the key has been shattered into 4 pieces and lost. You have to find all of the pieces and repair {TITAN'S THUNDER} to open the port of Portishead"

{Hero:}
"Wow, so the Portishead port really does exist!!! I swear I'll get there even if I have to give up my ghost!" "And why doesn't someone fix the gate?"

{Wizard:}
"You know, there are no people, nobody wants to work, they just want to sail around on boats and barter."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.151.149.0.m:
{Boss:}
"Ha, look, a loot! Go after him, Hugo!"

{Hugo:}
"Yes, Boss, I'll wring his neck!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.158.237.0.m:
{Corkes:}
"Hey lass, what's your name?" "Would you like to join me in a search for one port, the port of Portishead? Have you heard of it?"

{Astra:}
"Hi, my name is Astra. Those bastards locked up me in here. I didn't want to work for them...they forced me to trick people and steal their money" 
"And yes, I'd like to join you. What was it you said, Portishead? No, unfortunately, I've never heard of such port, but I'll help you look for it!"

{Corkes:}
"Ok, then follow me, we have a lot of work to do."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.160.167.0.m:
{Swordsman:}
"Hey! You! Where do you think you're going? This place is very dangerous! Two criminals, Hugo and Boss, have been robbing and murdering here!!!"

{Captain:}
"Hello, knight. I believe I have to go this way, you must let me pass!"

{Swordsman:}
"No, I can't let you go, it's too dangerous!"

{Captain:}
"But don't worry, they will never catch up with me, I have a {Fast Horse!}"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.17.228.0.me:
{Gelu:}
"They went this way, but the path is barricaded, we woun´t be able to pass, what now?"

{Sharpshooter:}
“Our only choice is to go through the {waterfalls} …  Look! Over there! Someone is drowning! ...”

map.[hota] portishead.guards.26.121.1.me:
{John Seer:}
"Welcome, Hero, what do you want?"

{Hero:}
"Greetings ... hmm, do you happen to have a brother?"

{John Seer:}
"Yes, my brother Jack, he is the best seer you can find. Have you met him?"

{Hero:}
"Yes, he told me we are going to fight against five enemies and we have to fight in three to defeat them. I don't quite understand that. Do you?"

{John Seer:}
"If my brother said it, then it must be true, but only time will tell, I´m going to give you a different advice: If you want to sail this way, you have to avoid the {Kelp} ... Can you see the one behind you? It's very dangerous, don't step on it! Good luck."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.33.170.0.me:
{Gelu:}
"Giselle, is that you? Are you alright?"

{Giselle:}
"Oh Gelu, all is lost, The Necromancers did it, they ambushed us and now they are holding me here! If you free me and they´ll find out, they will kill us. I managed to save our Town Portal magic, but I´ve lost the magical power {Scholar} to pass it to you. Run away and leave me here, I cannot come with you!"

{Gelu:}
"I won't leave you here! I will free you from this prison and we'll run to the swamps. I have Wayfarer's Boots for you. There, I'll help you restore your magical power {Scholar}. I´ve met new friends, they will help us and then we will carry out our revenge! Follow me!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.33.196.0.me:
{Gelu:}
"No ...  this is terrible, everything is destroyed! "

{Sharpshooter:}
"Now watch out Gelu, they might still be here!!!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.52.67.0.mes:
{Jack Seer:}
"Greetings traveler, what does your heart desire?"

{Hero:}
"I'm looking for a port called Portishead, have you heard of it?"

{Jack Seer:}
"Have I heard or have I not...? I know not, but what I can is tell your future, do you want? — The cost is 5000 gold."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.58.183.0.me:
{Giselle:}
"Gelu, I'll go fight theTrolls. If manage to defeat them, I´ll gain my power back! You have to go for the Artifact to the Seer´s Hut."

{Gelu:}
"OK, let´s go!"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.58.27.0.mes:
{Giselle:}
"Hello, is there anyone in there?"

{Dracon:}
"Yes, I'm locked in here, my name is Dracon, please let me out!"

{Giselle:}
"So, Dracon, why are you imprisoned here, what did you do?

{Dracon:}
"I didn't do anything, they locked me up because I'm black as hell. Fucking racists!"

{Giselle:}
"Oh, so you're black, well, I'll let you out, but you'll work for us without pay... Okay?"

{Dracon:}
"Well, if there's no other way." (whispering): "Another fucking racist"

map.[hota] portishead.guards.75.202.0.me:
{Sharpshooter:}
"Gelu? Is that you? ... Where have you been? They raided our forest ... everyone is dead ..."

{Gelu:}
"What?! Who did this?" ... and Giselle? Is she alive?"

{Sharpshooter:}
"It was the Necromancers! They captured Giselle and took her with them. I don't know where they went, but {We must try to find her!} I'll come with you, to aid you in the search."

map.[hota] portishead.guards.86.239.0.me:
{Gelu:}
"We can´t go this way, a ghost dragon is guarding the path"

{Sharpshooter:}
“We must return to the {port} and find another way."

{Gelu:}
"Yeah we won't go through here now but the dragons are sitting on 100000 gold which would be nice. Maybe we'll come back later."

