map.[hota] portishead.guards.97.136.0.me:
{Tyris:}
"Lord Haart, we have been attacked, please, you have to return immediately!"

{Lord Haart:}
"I understand. Defend my kingdom in the meanwhile. I'm comming back and bringing reinforcement. My good friend from the north, King Crag Hack, and allies from the east, the Necromancers, they will certainly help us. Await me at dawn in {3 months!!!}"

{Trolls Wife:}
"Go away, man, I'm not going anywhere!!! 

Or should I roast you on the fire?"

{Leprechaun:}
"Get the hell out of here, or do you want to lose your other eye as well?"

{Captain:}
"Well, you're an interesting lot, I must take a look at your camp here."

{Leprechaun:}
"Come on, handsome, our prison here is very nice and we already have one girl locked in there, I'll introduce you ha ha ha ... get him, lads, and show him what we've got!!!"

